<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How The Meals That Made Us handles information about visitors">
	<article class="legal-page">
		<h1 class="page-title">Privacy</h1>
		<p class="page-lede">The short version: this is a family recipe site, and we don’t collect information about you.</p>
		<p><strong>Effective date:</strong> October 16, 2026</p>

		<h2>What we collect</h2>
		<p>Nothing directly. There are no accounts, no signups, no comments, and no forms on this site. We don’t set advertising cookies, and we don’t currently use any analytics.</p>

		<h2>Hosting and Cloudflare</h2>
		<p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Like any web host, Cloudflare keeps standard server and edge logs, such as your IP address, browser type, and the pages you request, to keep the site running and secure. Cloudflare also runs automatic bot-detection JavaScript to block abusive traffic. You can read how Cloudflare handles that data in the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

		<h2>Email</h2>
		<p>Email sent to an address at this site’s domain is forwarded to us by Cloudflare Email Routing. We only use your message to reply to you.</p>

		<h2>Analytics</h2>
		<p>We may add privacy-friendly, cookieless Cloudflare Web Analytics in the future. If we do, we will update this page.</p>

		<h2>Selling data</h2>
		<p>We don’t sell, rent, or trade information about anyone.</p>

		<h2>Children</h2>
		<p>This site is for a general audience. We don’t collect personal information from anyone, including children under 13.</p>

		<h2>Changes</h2>
		<p>If anything here changes, we’ll update this page and the effective date above.</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:info@NavarreVal.com">info@NavarreVal.com</a>.</p>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
